{
  "lessonId": "L3M1L1",
  "title": "北義稀有品種 (Timorasso, Ruché, Freisa)",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0 0%,#7B1FA2 100%)'><h1>🍇 北義稀有品種寶藏</h1><p class='subtitle'>Timorasso, Ruché, Freisa - 瀕臨絕種的復興故事</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 Timorasso - 皮埃蒙特的白葡萄傳奇</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Colli Tortonesi DOC</div><h3>Timorasso (提莫拉索)</h3><div class='rarity-badge'>極度稀有 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div></div><div class='grape-story'><h4>📖 復興傳奇</h4><p>1980年代幾近絕種，僅剩少數老藤。釀酒師 <strong>Walter Massa</strong> 在 1987 年開始復興計畫，如今成為義大利最昂貴的白葡萄酒之一。</p></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 風味特徵</h5><ul><li>濃郁的白桃、杏桃、蜂蜜</li><li>鹹礦物感（海洋氣息）</li><li>杏仁、榛果、香草</li><li>陳年後出現汽油、蜂蠟</li></ul></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🔬 釀造特色</h5><ul><li>常用橡木桶發酵與陳年</li><li>15-20% 酒精度（極高）</li><li>高酸度、飽滿酒體</li><li>陳年潛力 15-20 年</li></ul></div></div><div class='tasting-profile'><div class='profile-bar'><span class='label'>酸度</span><div class='bar'><div class='fill' style='width:95%;background:#9C27B0'></div></div><span class='value'>高</span></div><div class='profile-bar'><span class='label'>酒體</span><div class='bar'><div class='fill' style='width:90%;background:#9C27B0'></div></div><span class='value'>飽滿</span></div><div class='profile-bar'><span class='label'>複雜度</span><div class='bar'><div class='fill' style='width:98%;background:#9C27B0'></div></div><span class='value'>極高</span></div><div class='profile-bar'><span class='label'>陳年潛力</span><div class='bar'><div class='fill' style='width:92%;background:#9C27B0'></div></div><span class='value'>15-20年</span></div></div><div class='price-comparison'><p><strong>價格帶：</strong>€€€€ - 頂級酒款可達 €100-200+</p><p><strong>對比：</strong>價格與品質可媲美勃根地特級園白酒</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌸 Ruché - 芳香女王</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Ruché di Castagnole Monferrato DOCG</div><h3>Ruché (魯凱)</h3><div class='rarity-badge'>稀有 ⭐⭐⭐⭐</div></div><div class='grape-story'><h4>📖 神秘起源</h4><p>DNA 研究顯示可能源自法國或巴爾幹地區，但在皮埃蒙特的 <strong>Castagnole Monferrato</strong> 找到真正的家。2010 年獲得 DOCG 認證。</p></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 風味炸彈</h5><ul><li>玫瑰花瓣、紫羅蘭（極濃郁）</li><li>草莓、覆盆莓、櫻桃</li><li>丁香、肉桂、白胡椒</li><li>獨特的玫瑰精油香氣</li></ul></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🎯 適飲時機</h5><ul><li>年輕飲用最佳（1-5年）</li><li>冰涼飲用（12-14°C）</li><li>適合夏日戶外餐飲</li><li>完美的開胃酒選擇</li></ul></div></div><div class='pairing-section'><h4>🍴 配餐建議</h4><div class='pairing-options'><div class='pairing-item'>🥗 番茄莫札瑞拉沙拉</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍝 海鮮義大利麵</div><div class='pairing-item'>🦐 炸海鮮拼盤</div><div class='pairing-item'>🧀 新鮮起司</div><div class='pairing-item'>🍓 草莓甜點</div></div></div><div class='expert-note'><p>💡 <strong>專家秘訣：</strong>Ruché 的芳香強度極高，品飲前不需要醒酒，甚至建議稍微冰鎮以保持新鮮度。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Freisa - 古老的皮埃蒙特紅酒</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Freisa d'Asti DOC / Freisa di Chieri DOC</div><h3>Freisa (弗雷伊薩)</h3><div class='rarity-badge'>傳統品種 ⭐⭐⭐</div></div><div class='grape-story'><h4>📖 歷史地位</h4><p>在 <strong>Nebbiolo</strong> 崛起之前，Freisa 曾是皮埃蒙特最重要的紅葡萄。19 世紀末面積廣大，如今大多被 Barbera 和 Nebbiolo 取代。</p></div><div class='style-variants'><h4>🍾 三種釀造風格</h4><div class='variants-grid'><div class='variant-card secco'><h5>干型 (Secco)</h5><p><strong>風格：</strong>類似 Nebbiolo 的結構</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>覆盆莓、玫瑰、單寧強勁</p><p><strong>陳年：</strong>5-10 年</p></div><div class='variant-card amabile'><h5>微甜 (Amabile)</h5><p><strong>風格：</strong>傳統風格、微氣泡</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>草莓、紫羅蘭、清爽</p><p><strong>飲用：</strong>年輕飲用、冰鎮</p></div><div class='variant-card frizzante'><h5>氣泡 (Frizzante)</h5><p><strong>風格：</strong>傳統農家風格</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>櫻桃、花香、活潑</p><p><strong>場合：</strong>開胃酒、派對</p></div></div></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 共同特徵</h5><ul><li>明亮的紅寶石色</li><li>高酸度（清爽活潑）</li><li>紅色漿果主導</li><li>獨特的玫瑰與紫羅蘭香</li><li>單寧中等到高</li></ul></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🎯 市場定位</h5><ul><li>價格親民（€€-€€€）</li><li>適合日常餐酒</li><li>本地消費為主</li><li>出口量少但品質優</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 三大稀有品種比較</h2><div class='comparison-table'><table><tr><th>特性</th><th>Timorasso</th><th>Ruché</th><th>Freisa</th></tr><tr><td><strong>顏色</strong></td><td>白葡萄</td><td>紅葡萄</td><td>紅葡萄</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DOCG/DOC</strong></td><td>Colli Tortonesi</td><td>Ruché di Castagnole Monferrato DOCG</td><td>Freisa d'Asti, Freisa di Chieri</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要產區</strong></td><td>Tortona 丘陵</td><td>Castagnole Monferrato</td><td>Asti, Chieri</td></tr><tr><td><strong>稀有度</strong></td><td>極稀有（復興中）</td><td>稀有</td><td>中等稀有</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風格</strong></td><td>飽滿、複雜、礦物</td><td>芳香、花香、清新</td><td>多變（干型/微甜/氣泡）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>陳年潛力</strong></td><td>15-20 年</td><td>1-5 年</td><td>5-10 年（干型）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格</strong></td><td>€€€€-€€€€€</td><td>€€-€€€</td><td>€€-€€€</td></tr><tr><td><strong>最佳飲溫</strong></td><td>10-12°C</td><td>12-14°C</td><td>14-16°C (secco), 10-12°C (frizzante)</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏅 頂級生產者</h2><div class='producers-grid'><div class='producer-card'><div class='producer-logo'>T</div><h4>Timorasso 頂級酒莊</h4><ul><li><strong>Walter Massa</strong> - 復興先驅</li><li><strong>Vigneti Massa</strong> - Derthona 傳奇</li><li><strong>La Colombera</strong> - Derthona Montino</li><li><strong>Claudio Mariotto</strong> - Pitasso</li></ul><p class='price-note'>代表酒款：€80-150</p></div><div class='producer-card'><div class='producer-logo'>R</div><h4>Ruché 精選酒莊</h4><ul><li><strong>Montalbera</strong> - Laccento DOCG</li><li><strong>Cantine Sant'Agata</strong> - 傳統風格</li><li><strong>Ferraris</strong> - Altavilla</li><li><strong>Scarpa</strong> - 優雅風格</li></ul><p class='price-note'>代表酒款：€15-35</p></div><div class='producer-card'><div class='producer-logo'>F</div><h4>Freisa 經典酒莊</h4><ul><li><strong>Vajra</strong> - 現代干型風格</li><li><strong>Aldo Vajra</strong> - Fossati</li><li><strong>Cavallotto</strong> - 傳統風格</li><li><strong>Bric Cenciurio</strong> - frizzante 專家</li></ul><p class='price-note'>代表酒款：€12-30</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 專家級配餐</h2><div class='advanced-pairing'><div class='pairing-section'><h4>🍷 Timorasso</h4><div class='dish-grid'><div class='dish'>🦞 龍蝦燉飯（高級餐廳必選）</div><div class='dish'>🐟 烤比目魚配白松露</div><div class='dish'>🧀 陳年 Parmigiano-Reggiano</div><div class='dish'>🦀 蟹肉義大利餃</div></div><p class='pairing-principle'><strong>原則：</strong>需要同等複雜度與飽滿度的料理才能匹配</p></div><div class='pairing-section'><h4>🌸 Ruché</h4><div class='dish-grid'><div class='dish'>🍅 番茄冷湯</div><div class='dish'>🥗 水牛莫札瑞拉沙拉</div><div class='dish'>🦐 蒜香蝦</div><div class='dish'>🍓 草莓提拉米蘇</div></div><p class='pairing-principle'><strong>原則：</strong>輕盈、新鮮、芳香的料理，避免重口味</p></div><div class='pairing-section'><h4>🍷 Freisa</h4><div class='dish-grid'><div class='dish'>🍕 瑪格麗特披薩</div><div class='dish'>🍝 番茄肉醬麵</div><div class='dish'>🍖 烤兔肉</div><div class='dish'>🧀 中度陳年起司</div></div><p class='pairing-principle'><strong>原則：</strong>傳統皮埃蒙特料理、酸度平衡油脂</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Timorasso 是義大利最昂貴的白葡萄酒之一，由 Walter Massa 復興</div><div class='point'>✓ Timorasso 具有極高的酸度、酒精度和陳年潛力（15-20年）</div><div class='point'>✓ Ruché 擁有獨特的玫瑰精油香氣，2010年獲得DOCG認證</div><div class='point'>✓ Ruché 適合年輕飲用並稍微冰鎮（12-14°C）</div><div class='point'>✓ Freisa 有三種風格：干型、微甜和氣泡</div><div class='point'>✓ 這三個品種都是皮埃蒙特的稀有寶藏，展現了該區的多樣性</div></div></section></div><style>.grape-profile{background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}.profile-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px;border-bottom:3px solid #9C27B0;padding-bottom:20px}.origin-badge{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0,#7B1FA2);color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:25px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px}.profile-header h3{font-size:2.2rem;margin:15px 0;color:#2c3e50}.rarity-badge{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f39c12,#e67e22);color:#fff;padding:6px 18px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700}.grape-story{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8f9fa,#e9ecef);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;margin:25px 0;border-left:5px solid #9C27B0}.grape-story h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#9C27B0;font-size:1.3rem}.grape-story p{margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.grape-story strong{color:#9C27B0;font-weight:700}.characteristics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin:25px 0}.char-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f8f9fa);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:4px solid #9C27B0;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.char-card h5{margin:0 0 15px;color:#9C27B0;font-size:1.2rem}.char-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.char-card li{color:#2c3e50;margin:8px 0}.tasting-profile{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;margin:25px 0;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.profile-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 100px;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin:15px 0}.profile-bar .label{font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50}.profile-bar .bar{height:25px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.profile-bar .fill{height:100%;transition:width .5s;border-radius:12px}.profile-bar .value{text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:#9C27B0}.price-comparison{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffeaa7);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:25px;border-left:5px solid #f39c12}.price-comparison p{margin:8px 0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8}.price-comparison strong{color:#e67e22}.pairing-section{margin:25px 0}.pairing-section h4{color:#9C27B0;margin-bottom:15px;font-size:1.3rem}.pairing-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:12px}.pairing-item{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f5e9,#c8e6c9);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50;border-left:4px solid#4CAF50}.expert-note{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f2fd,#bbdefb);padding:20px 25px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:25px;border-left:5px solid #2196f3}.expert-note p{margin:0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.expert-note strong{color:#1976d2}.style-variants{margin:25px 0}.style-variants h4{color:#9C27B0;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center}.variants-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.variant-card{padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative}.variant-card.secco{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffebee,#ffcdd2);border-top:5px solid #c62828}.variant-card.amabile{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fce4ec,#f8bbd0);border-top:5px solid #ad1457}.variant-card.frizzante{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f3e5f5,#e1bee7);border-top:5px solid#7b1fa2}.variant-card h5{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem;color:#2c3e50;text-align:center}.variant-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50}.variant-card strong{color:#9C27B0}.comparison-table{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.12);overflow-x:auto}.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:800px}.comparison-table th{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0,#7B1FA2);color:#fff;padding:18px 15px;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700}.comparison-table td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid#e0e0e0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#f8f9fa}.comparison-table strong{color:#9C27B0}.producers-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px}.producer-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:5px solid #9C27B0;text-align:center}.producer-logo{width:80px;height:80px;margin:0 auto 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0,#7B1FA2);color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(156,39,176,.3)}.producer-card h4{margin:0 0 20px;color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.3rem}.producer-card ul{text-align:left;margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.producer-card li{color:#2c3e50;margin:8px 0}.producer-card strong{color:#9C27B0}.price-note{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffeaa7);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;color:#e67e22;margin:0}.advanced-pairing{display:grid;gap:30px}.advanced-pairing .pairing-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-left:5px solid #9C27B0}.advanced-pairing h4{margin:0 0 20px;color:#9C27B0;font-size:1.4rem;text-align:center}.dish-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.dish{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8f9fa,#e9ecef);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50;border-left:4px solid #9C27B0}.pairing-principle{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f2fd,#bbdefb);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50}.pairing-principle strong{color:#1976d2}.key-points{display:grid;gap:12px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f3e5f5,transparent);padding:18px 25px;border-left:5px solid #9C27B0;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.7}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "誰是 Timorasso 葡萄復興的先驅者？",
      "options": [
        "Angelo Gaja",
        "Walter Massa",
        "Bruno Giacosa",
        "Paolo Scavino"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Walter Massa 在 1987 年開始 Timorasso 的復興計畫，將這個幾近絕種的品種重新帶回市場。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Ruché 葡萄最獨特的風味特徵是什麼？",
      "options": [
        "黑莓和巧克力",
        "玫瑰精油和紫羅蘭",
        "青草和醋栗",
        "無花果和蜂蜜"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Ruché 以其極濃郁的玫瑰精油和紫羅蘭香氣聞名，這是其最顯著的特徵。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Freisa 葡萄可以釀造成幾種不同的風格？",
      "options": [
        "1種",
        "2種",
